{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜Sandisk新嵌入式儲存器登場 物聯網設備可免改硬件升級NAND           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">Sandisk於德國慕尼黑電子展期間發表新一代嵌入式快閃記憶體驅動器iNAND CL EM181，採用e.MMC 5.1A標準，備有64GB、128GB及256GB三種容量，最高順序讀取及寫入速度分別為300MB/s與225MB/s。產品針對機頂盒、OTT串流設備、智能家電及數據中心日誌記錄等AIoT應用，並讓設備製造商保留原有e.MMC架構之餘轉用較新NAND技術，減省硬件改動及重新認證開支。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.538434+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:53.131558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:53.131558+00:00","content_hash":"7a6bbe5f11bfb46e85a4bddc6f7e244d227ffb6c0d15894ccae32a6a14554fdc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}